    implementation, config review, marketplace mapping, coverage gaps — every dispatched agent riding the
    sol-class lane. <b>The 1024-agent target is not aspirational; the 2×16 fleet already reserved 279 runners on the wall.</b></p></div></div>

  <div class="logentry rv"><span class="ldate">2026-08-24</span>
